From: Remote Project <bots@joleeconsultants.com>
Subject: Prevent mic/webcam restore from re-enabling after user OFF

Re-read localStorage (and userMediaIntentRef) before postRestore enable;
gate status=true on storage still wanting on; toggle OFF clears intent so
in-flight restore timers cannot flip capture back on.

---
